{
  "book": "Can't Hurt Me",
  "author": "David Goggins",
  "total_audio_duration_sec": 131.448,
  "scenes": [
    {
      "scene_id": 1,
      "start_sec": 0.0,
      "end_sec": 4.2,
      "duration_sec": 4.2,
      "script_text": "Can't hurt me by David Goggins in two minutes."
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 2,
      "start_sec": 4.2,
      "end_sec": 6.7,
      "duration_sec": 2.5,
      "script_text": "Most people live their entire lives"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 3,
      "start_sec": 6.7,
      "end_sec": 9.2,
      "duration_sec": 2.5,
      "script_text": "in the safe zone, comfortable, soft,"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 4,
      "start_sec": 9.2,
      "end_sec": 12.27,
      "duration_sec": 3.07,
      "script_text": "and full of excuses. But here's the brutal truth."
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 5,
      "start_sec": 12.27,
      "end_sec": 15.7,
      "duration_sec": 3.43,
      "script_text": "You are only using forty percent of your true capability."
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 6,
      "start_sec": 15.7,
      "end_sec": 18.2,
      "duration_sec": 2.5,
      "script_text": "When your mind starts screaming that"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 7,
      "start_sec": 18.2,
      "end_sec": 20.7,
      "duration_sec": 2.5,
      "script_text": "you are completely exhausted, broken, and"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 8,
      "start_sec": 20.7,
      "end_sec": 23.42,
      "duration_sec": 2.72,
      "script_text": "ready to quit, that is not your limit."
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 9,
      "start_sec": 23.42,
      "end_sec": 27.11,
      "duration_sec": 3.69,
      "script_text": "That is just your brain trying to protect you from pain."
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 10,
      "start_sec": 27.11,
      "end_sec": 29.61,
      "duration_sec": 2.5,
      "script_text": "David Goggins grew up broke, abused,"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 11,
      "start_sec": 29.61,
      "end_sec": 32.11,
      "duration_sec": 2.5,
      "script_text": "depressed, and weighed nearly three hundred"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 12,
      "start_sec": 32.11,
      "end_sec": 34.61,
      "duration_sec": 2.5,
      "script_text": "pounds. He was spraying cockroach poison"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 13,
      "start_sec": 34.61,
      "end_sec": 37.11,
      "duration_sec": 2.5,
      "script_text": "for a living, drowning in self"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 14,
      "start_sec": 37.11,
      "end_sec": 39.61,
      "duration_sec": 2.5,
      "script_text": "pity and fear. Until one day,"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 15,
      "start_sec": 39.61,
      "end_sec": 42.11,
      "duration_sec": 2.5,
      "script_text": "he stood in front of the"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 16,
      "start_sec": 42.11,
      "end_sec": 45.2,
      "duration_sec": 3.09,
      "script_text": "mirror, shaved his head, and created the accountability mirror."
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 17,
      "start_sec": 45.2,
      "end_sec": 48.89,
      "duration_sec": 3.69,
      "script_text": "He taped post it notes of brutal truths to the glass."
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 18,
      "start_sec": 48.89,
      "end_sec": 52.34,
      "duration_sec": 3.45,
      "script_text": "You are fat. You are lazy. Stop lying to yourself."
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 19,
      "start_sec": 52.34,
      "end_sec": 54.84,
      "duration_sec": 2.5,
      "script_text": "He did not sugarcoat anything. You"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 20,
      "start_sec": 54.84,
      "end_sec": 57.34,
      "duration_sec": 2.5,
      "script_text": "cannot fix a problem you refuse"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 21,
      "start_sec": 57.34,
      "end_sec": 60.43,
      "duration_sec": 3.09,
      "script_text": "to acknowledge. Radical honesty is the prerequisite for transformation."
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 22,
      "start_sec": 60.43,
      "end_sec": 62.93,
      "duration_sec": 2.5,
      "script_text": "To become the only man in"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 23,
      "start_sec": 62.93,
      "end_sec": 65.43,
      "duration_sec": 2.5,
      "script_text": "history to complete Navy Seal training,"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 24,
      "start_sec": 65.43,
      "end_sec": 67.93,
      "duration_sec": 2.5,
      "script_text": "army ranger school, and air force"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 25,
      "start_sec": 67.93,
      "end_sec": 70.43,
      "duration_sec": 2.5,
      "script_text": "tactical air controller training, he developed"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 26,
      "start_sec": 70.43,
      "end_sec": 72.93,
      "duration_sec": 2.5,
      "script_text": "the cookie jar concept. Whenever you"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 27,
      "start_sec": 72.93,
      "end_sec": 75.43,
      "duration_sec": 2.5,
      "script_text": "hit rock bottom, whenever you want"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 28,
      "start_sec": 75.43,
      "end_sec": 79.12,
      "duration_sec": 3.69,
      "script_text": "to collapse and surrender, you reach into your mental cookie jar."
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 29,
      "start_sec": 79.12,
      "end_sec": 81.62,
      "duration_sec": 2.5,
      "script_text": "You pull out the memory of"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 30,
      "start_sec": 81.62,
      "end_sec": 84.12,
      "duration_sec": 2.5,
      "script_text": "every hard thing you have ever"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 31,
      "start_sec": 84.12,
      "end_sec": 86.62,
      "duration_sec": 2.5,
      "script_text": "survived, every failure you overcame, and"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 32,
      "start_sec": 86.62,
      "end_sec": 89.12,
      "duration_sec": 2.5,
      "script_text": "you use that pain as raw"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 33,
      "start_sec": 89.12,
      "end_sec": 92.81,
      "duration_sec": 3.69,
      "script_text": "rocket fuel. You You must callus your mind the exact same way"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 34,
      "start_sec": 92.81,
      "end_sec": 96.5,
      "duration_sec": 3.69,
      "script_text": "you callus your hands. You do not build mental armor by meditating"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 35,
      "start_sec": 96.5,
      "end_sec": 100.19,
      "duration_sec": 3.69,
      "script_text": "on a sunny beach. You build it by doing what you hate"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 36,
      "start_sec": 100.19,
      "end_sec": 103.64,
      "duration_sec": 3.45,
      "script_text": "doing every single day. When it is cold, you run."
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 37,
      "start_sec": 103.64,
      "end_sec": 107.33,
      "duration_sec": 3.69,
      "script_text": "When you are tired, you study. When your muscles ache, you push"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 38,
      "start_sec": 107.33,
      "end_sec": 111.02,
      "duration_sec": 3.69,
      "script_text": "for one more mile. You take souls by outworking the person in"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 39,
      "start_sec": 111.02,
      "end_sec": 113.74,
      "duration_sec": 2.72,
      "script_text": "the mirror. Nobody is coming to save you."
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 40,
      "start_sec": 113.74,
      "end_sec": 117.43,
      "duration_sec": 3.69,
      "script_text": "No motivational video is going to do the push ups for you."
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 41,
      "start_sec": 117.43,
      "end_sec": 120.88,
      "duration_sec": 3.45,
      "script_text": "You have to be the master of your own mind."
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 42,
      "start_sec": 120.88,
      "end_sec": 124.57,
      "duration_sec": 3.69,
      "script_text": "So tell me in the comments below. Would you rather stay cozy"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 43,
      "start_sec": 124.57,
      "end_sec": 128.26,
      "duration_sec": 3.69,
      "script_text": "in your comfort zone, sixty percent unfulfilled, or push past the pain,"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 44,
      "start_sec": 128.26,
      "end_sec": 131.45,
      "duration_sec": 3.19,
      "script_text": "callous your mind, and become completely uncommon among the uncommon?"
    }
  ]
}